meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>Correction for:</p><p>Hotez PJ, Molyneux DH, Fenwick A, Ottesen E, Ehrlich Sachs S, et al. (2006) Incorporating a Rapid-Impact Package for Neglected Tropical Diseases with Programs for HIV/AIDS, Tuberculosis, and Malaria. PLoS Med 3(5): e102. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0030102">10.1371/journal.pmed.0030102</ext-link></p><p>In Table 1, under the column labeled &#x0201c;Deaths,&#x0201d; there should be an &#x0201c;e&#x0201d; footnote for the deaths from trypanosomiasis, Chagas disease, and leprosy, not a &#x0201c;c&#x0201d; as written.</p></body></article>